            284,
            48,
            '{"parser": "legacy-migration", "file_name": "jeen buddy guidelines general.docx", "file_type": "docx", "legacyData": {"legacy_id": "75268455-78e2-4210-a4d3-3d5792a6a7d4", "external_id": null, "collection": "collection", "type": "chunk-data", "tags": "", "user_id": "306916b02924f0142a236cc978b0d013", "create_date": "2026-03-15T07:09:53.894Z", "link_to_file": "https://jeenfilesdevweu.blob.core.windows.net/jeendocs/306916b02924f0142a236cc978b0d013/data/1773558588708-jeen buddy guidelines general.docx", "excerptKeywords": "KEYWORDS: Buddy, Jeen.ai, תוכנית, עובד חדש, חברה"}}'::jsonb,
            '2026-03-15T07:09:53.894000+00:00',
            $TRANS$Hi ________ how fun it is that you agreed to be part of the Buddy program Jeen.ai the only and best program in the company 😊 as part of the program, every new employee receives a Buddy that accompanies them during the first period and helps them integrate seamlessly into the team and the company. The duration of the program is two weeks, during which you serve as an initial point of contact for the new employee.$TRANS$
